# Versioning

Follow `.cursor/skills/versioning/SKILL.md`.

One `MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` for Cargo workspace version and `MODULE.bazel`
`module(version)`. Tags are `v` plus that number (`v0.1.0`). No `v` in
Bazel/Cargo.

While major is 0: breaking API change → minor; compatible work →
patch. Do not tag or bump unless the user asked to release.

A new tag is not done until `gh release create` has published it. Notes come
from that version's `CHANGELOG.md` section. Not a draft.

DESIGN.md / ROADMAP.md document versions (`Version 0.1`) are not the crate
version.
